      "description": "<p>-Delete old version before installing this new one!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>NEW FEATURE: Each light now has its OWN F12 sliders! Fine-tune the range and intensity of every flashlight individually, right from F12 (if your light is on while adjusting, turning it off and back on will apply the changes.)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Natively supports every vanilla flashlight plus all of <em>WTT Content Backport’s</em> added lights out of the box, no setup needed</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a public API so other mod authors can create add-ons and hook their own lights into the F12 menu instantly, with their own custom name.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
